@startuml
title TMFC011 : Resource Order Management -- eTOM/SID ABE Links

package "TMFC011 - Resource Order Management" {
  class "L2 Resource Order > Resource Order Management" as L2ResourceOrderManagement <<eTOM Business Activity>>
  class "Resource Order ABE" as ResourceOrderABE_TMFC011 <<SID Data Entity>>
}

package "TMFC012 - Resource Inventory" {
  class "Resource Order ABE" as ResourceOrderABE_TMFC012 <<SID Data Entity>>
}

package "TMFC010 - Resource Catalog" {
  class "Resource Specification ABE" as ResourceSpecificationABE <<SID Data Entity>>
}

package "TMFC068 - Resource Configuration & Activation" {
  class "Resource Configuration ABE" as ResourceConfigurationABE <<SID Data Entity>>
}

' Every link below is an eTOM-activity <-> SID-ABE link. Per the image's own
' legend, an arrow from the eTOM activity towards the SID ABE means
' information produced by the activity; the reverse arrow means information
' consumed by the activity. The image draws each of these pairs with an
' arrowhead at both ends (confirmed by zooming into both ends of each path --
' the internal link is one double-headed vertical arrow, the three links to
' the neighbouring components share a common vertical trunk out of
' "L2 Resource Order > Resource Order Management" that fans out into three
' branches, each ending in its own arrowhead at the destination ABE), i.e.
' both directions hold simultaneously for every pair below.

L2ResourceOrderManagement --> ResourceOrderABE_TMFC011 : produces
ResourceOrderABE_TMFC011 --> L2ResourceOrderManagement : is consumed by

' This link crosses into the neighbouring TMFC012 package -- Resource Order
' ABE here is TMFC012's own copy of the entity (distinct node from TMFC011's
' internal one above), per the image's own grouping boxes.
L2ResourceOrderManagement --> ResourceOrderABE_TMFC012 : produces
ResourceOrderABE_TMFC012 --> L2ResourceOrderManagement : is consumed by

L2ResourceOrderManagement --> ResourceSpecificationABE : produces
ResourceSpecificationABE --> L2ResourceOrderManagement : is consumed by

L2ResourceOrderManagement --> ResourceConfigurationABE : produces
ResourceConfigurationABE --> L2ResourceOrderManagement : is consumed by

legend right
  eTOM Business Activity = dashed-outline rectangle in source image
  SID Data Entity = cylinder in source image
  --> "produces" = eTOM activity to SID ABE arrow
  --> "is consumed by" = SID ABE to eTOM activity arrow
endlegend
@enduml
